WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
narrator: Start the mesh and analytics containers.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
narrator: Read Prometheus-format metrics.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
narrator: Inspect the analytics health response.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
narrator: Query session counts in one-minute buckets.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.000
narrator: Query preauthorization counts in the same format.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:57.000
narrator: The node metrics probe is optional and includes a fallback message.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
narrator: This fixture's empty audit directory does not establish paid traffic accounting.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.000
narrator: Remove the fixture.
